Action: ADDRESS SYSTEM WITH OUTPUT APPEND STREAM "stdout" ERROR APPEND STREAM "stdout"

Action: ADDRESS SYSTEM "std"
Line to stderr
Line to stdout
If you don't see 'Line to stderr' followed by 'Line to stdout', there is a problem!

Action: ADDRESS SYSTEM WITH OUTPUT STREAM "junk" ERROR STREAM "junk"

Action: ADDRESS SYSTEM "std"
Line 1 from 'junk' is: 'Line to stderr', should be: 'Line to stderr'
Line 2 from 'junk' is: 'Line to stdout', should be: 'Line to stdout'
